{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/595869-help-me-understand-the-week-of-nightmares","id":595869,"title":"Help me understand the week of nightmares","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-07-19T12:56:08-07:00","id":595869,"title":"Help me understand the week of nightmares","content":"I was reading the Time of Thin blood, and near the end it sort of describe the events of the Week of Nightmares. I was reading one of the parts about the werewolfs fighting some of the demons of Yomi and were losing badly.<br /> <br /> What do the demons of Yomi look like? The only description I got from reading was &quot;elephant=eared..&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1945-magicballz","name":"Magicballz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"175"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-19T13:23:49-07:00","id":595907,"title":"","content":"Demons of Yomi look like pretty much anything, and you can find stats for general servitors, among others, in The 1000 Hells.<br /> <br /> What happened, very briefly, in the WoN was that a lot of Ravnos younglings got killed, which woke up a lot of Ravnos elders, which also got killed, which woke up the clan founder, which led to a fight between said founder and one Boddhisattava each of the Thrashing Dragons, Resplendent Cranes, and Devil-Tigers. They would have been able to kill it on their own with 2/3 casualties to their numbers, but the Technocracy got scared and used several weapons comparable to nukes tuned to destroy spiritual threats. Then they focused some sun mirrors onto the Ravnos founder, which destroyed him and broke the Clan.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-19T16:47:28-07:00","id":596284,"title":"","content":"Where did you get this information. I read the Week of nightmares very briefly and it didn't go into details what dharma the boddhisattava were.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1945-magicballz","name":"Magicballz","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"175"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-19T18:52:23-07:00","id":596396,"title":"","content":"Those informations are scatered throw diverse booklines.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure if the Boddhisattvas would win (tough that was the prophecy), but it sure was a hellish battle.<br /> <br /> By he way, it triggered the 6th Maelstrom that changed the setting on various levels, even breaking the walls of Hell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-19T18:56:44-07:00","id":596398,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/595869-help-me-understand-the-week-of-nightmares?p=596396#post596396\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Those informations are scatered throw diverse booklines.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure if the Boddhisattvas would win (tough that was the prophecy), but it sure was a hellish battle.<br /> <br /> By he way, it triggered the 6th Maelstrom that changed the setting on various levels, even breaking the walls of Hell.</div> </div> </div> </div>The 6GM was triggered by events in the Underworld, when Xerxes Jones detonated a nuke by the mouth of the void and the Smiling Lord utilized several relic nukes around Stygia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-19T19:59:52-07:00","id":596424,"title":"","content":"It occurred roughly at the same time. As far as is known, the nuke of the Week of Nightmares helped, as did the other occurrences of the time both related and unrelated to Ravnos.<br /> <br /> Even the Alaru in Enoch had a hand on this, tough the details are as mysterious as the Alaru themselfs.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-19T21:07:28-07:00","id":596481,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>monteparnas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/595869-help-me-understand-the-week-of-nightmares?p=596424#post596424\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It occurred roughly at the same time. As far as is known, the nuke of the Week of Nightmares helped, as did the other occurrences of the time both related and unrelated to Ravnos.<br /> <br /> Even the Alaru in Enoch had a hand on this, tough the details are as mysterious as the Alaru themselfs.</div> </div> </div> </div>IIRC, the spirit nuke was a small part of the 6GM, but not as big as the ghost nuke used in the Underworld. The Alaru were freed by 6GM, but weren't part of the cause.<br /> <br /> Other events surrounding the Week of Nightmares include the Red Star/Antihelios/Wormwood appearing, the Perfect Metis was born (a Metis born without deformities), the Abyss the demons were trapped in was cracked by one or both of the magic nukes, the Avatar Storm started (initiated by the Spirit Nuke, I think?), Underworld Enoch got blown up (freeing the Alaru), and Imbued Hunters started popping up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writing up Clanbook: Aabbt","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/700-vysha","name":"Vysha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar700_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"602"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-19T21:22:48-07:00","id":596485,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Vysha</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/595869-help-me-understand-the-week-of-nightmares?p=596481#post596481\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">IIRC, the spirit nuke was a small part of the 6GM, but not as big as the ghost nuke used in the Underworld. The Alaru were freed by 6GM, but weren't part of the cause.<br /> <br /> Other events surrounding the Week of Nightmares include the Red Star/Antihelios/Wormwood appearing, the Perfect Metis was born (a Metis born without deformities), the Abyss the demons were trapped in was cracked by one or both of the magic nukes, the Avatar Storm started (initiated by the Spirit Nuke, I think?), Underworld Enoch got blown up (freeing the Alaru), and Imbued Hunters started popping up.</div> </div> </div> </div>What's more important about the Perfect Metis is that her parents were also metis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-19T21:55:49-07:00","id":596492,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/595869-help-me-understand-the-week-of-nightmares?p=596485#post596485\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> What's more important about the Perfect Metis is that her parents were also metis.</div> </div> </div> </div>Right, I forgot about that part. It's been too long since I read it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writing up Clanbook: Aabbt","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/700-vysha","name":"Vysha","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar700_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"602"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-20T03:39:00-07:00","id":596679,"title":"","content":"True.<br /> <br /> And also the True Black Hand was wiped out and Cappadocius' ghost finaly destroyed, rendering Augustus' search moot, tough he didn't knew it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-20T10:59:39-07:00","id":597072,"title":"","content":"So to sum up:<br /> Everyone's world (of darkness) got rocked in the space of a week, and that was the &quot;heads-up&quot; that the Time of Judgment (whatever that meant to each game-line) was approaching. Not in some distant future, not in a few generations, but in the very near future.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr />Avatar commissioned from the incomparable Melissa Uran.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/966-redford_blade","name":"Redford_Blade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar966_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"90"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-20T11:33:27-07:00","id":597096,"title":"","content":"My impression was that the Ravnos antediluvian and the Bodhisattvas opened big-ass gateways to the Yin and Yang worlds to summon minions/powers to use in their fight, and both happening at once tore open a third, uncontrolled rift to the Yomi world for good measure. It seemed to me that the interaction of all those forces that were never meant to touch was what kicked off the Avatar Storm, not the spirit nukes slamming the gateways shut before even more catastrophic damage could be done.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3505-matt-the-bruins-fan","name":"Matt the Bruins fan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3505_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2401"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-20T16:47:54-07:00","id":597499,"title":"","content":"My impression is that a lot of things happened at the same time for the sake of not defining one as the major reason, so you choose your explanation for whatever shattered the literals walls of Hell.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T09:51:28-07:00","id":606728,"title":"","content":"About the WoN, I knew about almost all of the above that everyone posted, but the Aralu in Underworld Enoch woke up and escaped? I thought they were destroyed along with the rest of the city. Where/which book is this detailed? I may have misread it in Vampire Storytellers Handbook, Revised, but I thought from reading the &quot;Fall of the Tal'mahe'Ra&quot; in that book that the Aralu were destroyed, not freed.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/835/7xu8.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0By9UuUWWH6CiMVlhWHMwNWcyaG8&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Garou Gifts List, Fera Gifts List, Garou Totems List and other assorted OPP/White Wolf goodies</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","name":"Su-tehp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2710_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T12:02:47-07:00","id":606900,"title":"","content":"Ends of Empire implies that the Aralu were not destroyed in the relic nuke attack. But Ends of Empire was early in the WoN and may have been a hint of a possible Gehenna scenario that was never used.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/293-lncbill","name":"lncbill","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar293_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T16:37:28-07:00","id":607256,"title":"","content":"In the end no one knows shit about the Alaru, is only hinted that they had a hand about the WoN.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>#NothingAboutUsWithoutUs<br /> #AutismPride<br /> She/her pronouns","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5826-monteparnas","name":"monteparnas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5826_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6710"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-29T19:22:01-07:00","id":607349,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lncbill</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/595869-help-me-understand-the-week-of-nightmares?p=606900#post606900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ends of Empire implies that the Aralu were not destroyed in the relic nuke attack. But Ends of Empire was early in the WoN and may have been a hint of a possible Gehenna scenario that was never used.</div> </div> </div> </div>Time to break out my copy of Ends of Empire again. I really don't remember that, but then I haven't looked at EoE since I bought it when it was published. That's what, 16 years by now?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/835/7xu8.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imagizer.imageshack.us/v2/125x125q90/546/wpur.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/folderview?id=0By9UuUWWH6CiMVlhWHMwNWcyaG8&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Complete Garou Gifts List, Fera Gifts List, Garou Totems List and other assorted OPP/White Wolf goodies</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2710-su-tehp","name":"Su-tehp","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2710_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"532"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}